{"unit_id":"LaplaceYoung__dsh-directorx#card-zh","repo":"LaplaceYoung/dsh-directorx","commit":"d63c425b4d6c40f3db30ccd433d24ed34947c8af","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DirectorX（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：把 DSH 用于端到端 AI 影视与视频制作。它通过 DSH 工具、技能、系统提示词和设置服务接入，并在 WebUI 提供配置页、媒体结果卡片、分镜画布与编辑工作台。主要功能包括视觉问答及图像、视频、音频生成，剧本与镜头规划，素材连续性管理，基于知识库和技能的导演工作流，以及本地视频剪辑、混音、字幕和质检。适合需要从创意简报推进到可编辑交付物的创作者与制作团队。云端模型需按所选服务配置端点和凭据；也可使用 mock 模式。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:36-95","src/tools.ts:401-500","src/tools.ts:1863-1927","src/client/index.ts:80-124"]}
{"unit_id":"LaplaceYoung__dsh-directorx#card-en","repo":"LaplaceYoung/dsh-directorx","commit":"d63c425b4d6c40f3db30ccd433d24ed34947c8af","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DirectorX is a DSH Web plugin for AI video production. It adds vision and media generation, knowledge and skills, a storyboard canvas, previews, and browser editing. FFmpeg handles local edits, mixing, subtitles, and checks. Configure cloud endpoints and credentials, or use mock modes.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:36-95","src/tools.ts:401-500","src/tools.ts:1863-1927","src/client/index.ts:80-124"]}
